  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HEARD - Health of Ethiopian Animals for Rural Development -Component 1 in the Amhara Regional State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;In line with the objectives of the HEARD, the proposed action aims to increase livestock productivity and improve marketing by strengthening the capacity of the veterinary service for information gathering, analysis and strategic animal health interventions by both public and private sectors, and by developing innovative and gender sensitive herd health approaches. The action specifically intends to to meet the result three and to contribute for result one of the HEARD projects thereby contributes for the achievement of the specific and overall objectives of the HEARD action.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
